+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="utf-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
+  <meta name="theme-color" content="#087b69">
+  <title>No nearby outlet: what manufacturers imply for electric seats | BidetFit</title>
+  <meta name="description" content="Manufacturer-backed answer for bathrooms without a suitable outlet. Prefer non-electric categories unless a proper receptacle exists.">
+  <link rel="canonical" href="https://priyanshchordia.com/bidetfit/answers/no-outlet-electric-seat.html">
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/site.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <a class="skip-link" href="#content">Skip to content</a>
+  <header class="site-header"><div class="header-inner"><a class="logo" href="/bidetfit/"><span class="logo-mark" aria-hidden="true">B</span>BidetFit</a><nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Primary"><a href="/bidetfit/">Home</a><a class="nav-primary" href="/bidetfit/fit-checker.html">Fit checker</a><a href="/bidetfit/how-to-measure.html">Measure</a><a href="/bidetfit/disclosure.html">Disclosure</a></nav></div></header>
+  <main id="content">
+    <section class="page-hero"><div class="narrow">
+      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/bidetfit/">BidetFit</a><span>/</span><span>Answers</span></div>
+      <span class="eyebrow">Fit question</span>
+      <h1>No nearby outlet: should I still buy an electric bidet seat?</h1>
+      <p class="lede">Only if a suitable bathroom receptacle is available or will be installed correctly. Otherwise start with non-electric categories that use water pressure.</p>
+    </div></section>
+    <article class="section"><div class="narrow prose">
+      <h2>Short answer</h2>
+      <p>Electric seats need power. If the fit checker flags no suitable outlet, treat that as a category blocker for electric seats—not a cue to use an extension cord as the product plan. Non-electric attachments, some non-electric seats, and handheld sprayers remain the practical path until power is resolved.</p>
+      <h2>Manufacturer and merchant sources</h2>
+      <ul>
+        <li><a href="https://support.hellotushy.com/en-US/what-are-tushy%E2%80%99s-electric-bidet-seat-dimensions-3543339" rel="noreferrer">TUSHY electric seat dimensions support article</a> — electric seats are dimensioned as powered products; power availability is part of install planning.</li>
+        <li><a href="https://bidetking.com/pages/non-electric-bidet-attachment-fitment-guide" rel="noreferrer">BidetKing non-electric attachment fitment guide</a> — documents attachment fit checks that do not assume electricity.</li>
+        <li><a href="https://biobidet.com/pages/compatibility" rel="noreferrer">Bio Bidet compatibility guide</a> — compatibility screening before purchase.</li>
+      </ul>
+      <p>BidetFit does not provide electrical code advice. Wet-location receptacle work belongs to qualified local guidance and the product’s own instructions.</p>
+      <h2>Decision order</h2>
+      <ol>
+        <li>Confirm outlet availability honestly (yes / no / unsure).</li>
+        <li>If no or unsure, screen non-electric categories first.</li>
+        <li>Still verify rear clearance, bolt spacing, bowl length, and water connection.</li>
+      </ol>
+      <div class="callout danger"><strong>No commission claim.</strong> Affiliate applications are not approvals. This page contains no affiliate checkout links.</div>
+      <div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="../fit-checker.html">Re-run the fit checker</a><a class="button secondary" href="../no-outlet-bidet-options.html">No-outlet category guide</a></div>
+    </div></article>
+  </main>
+  <footer class="site-footer"><div class="shell footer-grid"><div><a class="logo" href="/bidetfit/"><span class="logo-mark" aria-hidden="true">B</span>BidetFit</a><p class="small">Useful answers can publish without affiliate links.</p></div><div class="footer-links"><a href="../about.html">Method</a><a href="../disclosure.html">Disclosure</a><a href="../privacy.html">Privacy</a></div></div></footer>
